{"rev":12,"ts":"2026-10-29T22:04:23.521622796+00:00","fields":{"__previous_part_content__":"Previous Part: [06](06-discoverable-mcp-surface.md) | Next Part: [08](08-installed-pilot-acceptance.md)\n\n# 07 — Switch new runs to the native planning route\n\n## Outcome\n\nUpdate the new-run workflow guidance/routing so native Session→Mission MCP\nplanning is the default and classic folders are no longer scaffolded for new\nruns, while old classic dossiers remain readable provenance and migration is\nexplicit.\n\n## Non-goal\n\nDo not mass-migrate old Missions/dossiers, delete archives, or change an\nalready active execution route.\n\n## Inputs and implementation boundary\n\nUse W6's implemented contract; installed availability is verified in W8.\nThe existing route selector is evidence\nthat classic versus Mission-backed selection is not creation; replace only the\nnew-run entry path. Guidance changes belong here, not to planning itself.\n\nUpdate the owning prompt-ingestion, refine-ingest, execute-ingest,\nexecute-roadmap and roadmap-authoring/execution contracts together with\ninstallation/discovery guidance and their generated copies. The important\nchange is permission to create/edit planning Missions before execution\napproval; remove the contradictory old prohibition only for that stage.\nRetain denoise, clarification, research, separate review gates and exact\nrequester approval. Missing native capabilities stop with actionable errors,\nnot silent fallback to a manually assembled transcript roadmap.\n\n## Expected post-state and validation\n\nA documented fresh-run route invokes named MCP intake/create/locate/plan tools\nand stops for exact-revision approval; historical classic route references\nremain read-only and migration remains opt-in.\n\nFuture targets: repository link audit plus an integration fixture that proves\nno transcript-folder/script prerequisite for a new run.\n\n## Checkpoint\n\nCommit routing/guidance and fixture evidence after validation.\n\n","__previous_part_id__":"7cd9270b-1662-4e2e-a1bd-cf3dbef75adf","component":"mission.native-planning.native-routing","depends_on":["aef38836-6230-4798-96bc-ac84c5e3e105"],"parts":[{"id":"b172cb69-c7c1-4f1f-9f8b-d7ccc4448b6a","kind":"requirements","path":"parts/requirements.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:44.442626150Z"},{"id":"7cd9270b-1662-4e2e-a1bd-cf3dbef75adf","kind":"design","path":"parts/design.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:44.514274625Z"},{"id":"f8af3823-ce46-4d34-a239-69b32c05ca2a","kind":"examples","path":"parts/examples.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:44.586599947Z"},{"id":"ab0f9add-df10-4443-b668-e79c9eaa973b","kind":"acceptance_criteria","path":"parts/acceptance-criteria.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:44.657656826Z"},{"id":"a336a4f9-f20b-4958-a285-9a354aa266f6","kind":"validation","path":"parts/validation.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:44.732335552Z"},{"id":"fe773c4c-4f46-4a22-a3c9-722e2b96fd84","kind":"notes","path":"parts/notes.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T21:58:44.803602482Z"},{"id":"dbd5299c-52eb-4148-bc11-076a7fce86ef","kind":"objective","path":"parts/objective.md","frozen":false,"created_at":"2026-10-29T22:00:44.579874243Z"}],"priority":"high","refs":[{"kind":"spec","urn":"ce://default/spec/ec2f0709-180f-4ccf-b692-601796f33e05","note":"Owning native planning contract"}],"related_specs":"ec2f0709-180f-4ccf-b692-601796f33e05","state":"planning","title":"[mission-native][W7] Mission-native New-run Workflow Routing and Guidance","type":"feature"}}
